  "description": "<p data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"311\">Dragon Ball FighterZ is een vechtgame voor de Nintendo Switch gebaseerd op de bekende Dragon Ball-serie. De game richt zich op snelle 2D-gevechten met iconische personages en spectaculaire aanvallen, geschikt voor zowel singleplayer als lokale multiplayer.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"322\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"341\"><strong data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"341\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"358\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"525\">\r\n<li data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"395\">\r\n<p data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"395\">⭐ Snelle en dynamische vechtgame</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"432\">\r\n<p data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"432\">⭐ Bekende Dragon Ball-personages</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"480\">\r\n<p data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"480\">⭐ Geschikt voor singleplayer en multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"525\">\r\n<p data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"525\">⭐ Toegankelijke maar diepgaande gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"547\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n<li data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"581\">\r\n<p data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"581\"><strong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"563\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"633\">\r\n<p data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"633\"><strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"593\">Game:</strong> <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\">Dragon Ball FighterZ</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"662\">\r\n<p data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"662\"><strong data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"646\">Genre:</strong> Fighting game</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n<p data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"692\"><strong data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"675\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"712\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"758\">\r\n<li data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"725\">\r\n<p data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"725\">Gamecard</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"758\">\r\n<p data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"758\"><em data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"756\">Geen doosje (los geleverd)</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"782\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"815\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>",
